(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[650]={"source_order":650,"notes":["It is not certain whether the left-margin hooked mark at about (380,1545) is a deliberate mark or a stray stroke or blemish.","The faint show-through was checked carefully for any real verso writing. Only the folio number has the darkness and correct orientation of writing on this side.","The page is ruled, with a vertical margin line at about x≈885–895. It is otherwise unwritten.","Faint mirror-reversed writing over the whole page is show-through from the recto, fol. 325. Its layout matches the adjacent fol. 325 entries (shelfmarks such as d.883 and c.223, titles, and extents ending ': D.'). It is not target-page text and is not inventoried as blocks.","No fragments of a facing page are visible within the canvas.","The ruled verso is otherwise unwritten. This was checked in all native tiles, covering the top, middle, bottom, outer margin, gutter margin and interlinear spaces.","The page has a vertical margin ruling at about x≈885–895.","Faint mirror-reversed writing across the page is show-through from the recto, fol. 325 (source order 649). It is not transcribed as target-page text.","There is a small dark hooked or arrow-like stroke in the far left margin at about [355,1515,50,65]. It is darker than the show-through, but it carries no legible text and its purpose is unclear. It may be a deliberate mark, a stray stroke or a blemish, so it is not recorded as a catalogue annotation.","Other dark specks and blots are judged to be dirt, foxing or ink spatter. They lie at about [1635,425], [1965,2075], [1180,3140], [2660,1420] and [1705,2605].","There is a small curved mark at the lower right corner, about [3085,4780]. It is probably paper damage or a stray stroke.","There is a small dark hooked or arrow-like stroke in the far left margin at about [355,1515,50,65], seen in native tile [0,0] at about x 360–400, y 1520–1575. It is darker than the show-through, but it is not legible as text. It may be a deliberate pointer or tick, or it may be a stray stroke. It has no evident attachment to any target-page entry, because the page is otherwise unwritten.","The raised character after '325' is shaped somewhat like a '6'. The reading 'b' depends on the supplied folio label 'fol. 325b' and on the verso context. The letterform alone does not secure it."],"records":[{"id":"css-prod-0650-r001","local_id":"r001","source_order":650,"folio":"325b","folio_label":"fol. 325b","sequence":1,"page_id":"095d5181-5aab-4f6d-b6a8-b0f85d8e3889","kind":"other","record_type":"non_catalogue_text","source_model_record_type":"non_catalogue_text","subtype":"folio_number","shelfmark":"","titleLiteral":"","titleNormalized":"","displayTitle":"Catalogue text","authorOrSource":"","source":"","subject":"","subjectGroup":"","date":"","extent":"","lines":"","script":"","incipit":"","transcription":"325ᵇ.","annotations":["Written in the top-left corner of the narrow left column, at about [415,330,200,145].","The 'b' is written raised, above and after the '5'. A dot follows it.","The folio number is darker than the surrounding show-through and is correctly oriented for this side of the leaf."],"uncertainties":["The raised letter is shaped somewhat like a '6'. It is read as 'b' because it matches the supplied folio label 'fol. 325b'.","There is a small dark hooked or arrow-like stroke in the far left margin at about [355,1515,50,65], seen in native tile [0,0] at about x 360–400, y 1520–1575. It is darker than the show-through, but it is not legible as text. It may be a deliberate pointer or tick, or it may be a stray stroke. It has no evident attachment to any target-page entry, because the page is otherwise unwritten.","The raised character after '325' is shaped somewhat like a '6'. The reading 'b' depends on the supplied folio label 'fol. 325b' and on the verso context. The letterform alone does not secure it."],"focused_readings":[],"reviewNotes":[],"editorialNotes":[],"relationships":[],"editorial_context":[],"block_ids":["b001"],"locations":[{"block_id":"b001","bbox":[415,330,200,145]}],"isCancelled":false,"needsReview":true,"human_verified":false,"verification_status":"machine_reviewed","change_audit":[],"sourceCitationURL":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/095d5181-5aab-4f6d-b6a8-b0f85d8e3889.json","auditPath":"audit/pages/0650.json","attachedNotes":[],"resolvedRelationships":[],"attachedRecords":[]}]};
